<title>SOUTH AFRICA: CRICKET-SOUTH AFRICA V AUSTRALIA THIRD TEST SCOREBOARD.</title>
<headline>CRICKET-SOUTH AFRICA V AUSTRALIA THIRD TEST SCOREBOARD.</headline>
<dateline>PRETORIA 1997-03-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Scoreboard on the fourth day</p>
<p>of the third and final test between South Africa and Australia</p>
<p>at Centurion Park on Monday:</p>
<p>Australia first innings 227 (S.Waugh 67; B.Schultz 4-52)</p>
<p>South Africa first innings 384 (A.Bacher 96, H.Cronje 79 not</p>
<p>out, G.McGrath 6-86)</p>
<p>Australia second innings (overnight 96-4)</p>
<p> M.Taylor c Richardson b Donald	    5</p>
<p> M.Hayden lbw Schultz			  0</p>
<p> M.Elliott b Donald			   12</p>
<p> M.Waugh b Symcox			     42</p>
<p> S.Waugh not out				60</p>
<p> G.Blewett b Donald			    0</p>
<p> M.Bevan b Symcox				5</p>
<p> I.Healy c Richardson b Schultz	   12</p>
<p> S.Warne lbw b Donald			 12</p>
<p> J.Gillespie b Donald			  0</p>
<p> G.McGrath b Klusener			 11</p>
<p> Extras (b-2 lb-6 w-4 nb-14)		26</p>
<p> Total (all out, 73.4 overs)	     185 </p>
<p>Fall of wickets: 1-5 2-10 3-28 4-94 5-99 6-108 7-131 8-164</p>
<p>9-164</p>
<p>Bowling: Donald 18-5-36-5 (3w), Schultz 17-4-39-2 (1w, 9nb),</p>
<p>Klusener 14.4-1-40-1 (4nb), Symcox 19-5-49-2, Kallis 5-1-13-0</p>
<p>(1nb)</p>
<p>South Africa second innings</p>
<p> G.Kirsten c Taylor b Blewett		6</p>
<p> A.Bacher c Elliott b Gillespie	    5</p>
<p> B.McMillan not out			    7</p>
<p> D.Cullinan not out			   12</p>
<p> Extras (w-1 nb-1)			     2</p>
<p> Total (two wickets, 6.4 overs)	   32</p>
<p>Fall of wickets: 1-11 2-15</p>
<p>Bowling: Gillespie 3.4-0-19-1 (1w), Blewett 3-0-13-1 (1nb)</p>
<p>Result: South Africa won by eight wickets.</p>
<p>Australia won the series 2-1.</p>
</text>
